Package: fugazibase
Title: Tidy Data from the Fugazi Live Series
Version: 0.3.03
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alex", "Mitrani", , "27974470+alexmitrani@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1091-7413")),
    person("Dischord Records", role = "cph",
           comment = "copyright holder of the Fugazi Live Series data - see LICENSE"))
Description: Tidy data documenting the live performance history of the band Fugazi. 
    The data includes details of all the live shows, 
    which songs were played and the durations of each track of each live recording, 
    which other bands accompanied Fugazi on each occasion, 
    the venue locations, and details of the Fugazi studio discography.  
    The primary source is the Fugazi Live Series website (Dischord Records). 
    The Fugazi Live Series data is supplemented with data from other sources, 
    for instance to establish the coordinates of the venue locations. 
